%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: H10_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: "I feel\u2026 nothing. I hear nothing. I see nothing. Oh, well that's probably
      because my eyes are still closed."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c25807cf07d3642429ff3af939d3ec19, type: 3}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I open my eyes but the bright light around me makes me instantly squint
      them together again.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I wonder where I have landed now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I take a second attempt to pry open my eyes.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Hello? Are you there, Mr. Horse?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Doesn't seem like he was transported with me this time, that's good.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I look around and see\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "\u2026nothing?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What? Everything's just white?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Everywhere I look, there is a void. Nothingness. But full of light.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Maybe I've finally found my way into the white room of a mental asylum.
      I certainly feel like that's where I belong right now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I am standing upright, but when I look down I don't see a floor, just white.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I try walking in a direction. I know I am moving but visually, it's all
      the same.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It doesn't even feel like walking, more like floating through space.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Maybe I'm a ghost.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oh my god, am I dead?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: If this is what the afterlife is like, I don't get what all the hype is
      about.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I stop in my tracks as I suddenly hear some faint murmurs in the distance.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Huh? What's that? It sounds like arguing voices. Not regular voices though,
      they seem distorted.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: After taking a few more steps I see an obscure sparkle in the air in front
      of me. I reach out my hand slowly and it abruptly gets stopped by a surface.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: It feels like glass, or a mirror, but almost completely invisible.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: My hand keeps lingering on the cold smooth barrier, while I listen for
      anything I can make out from the mutters coming from behind it.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "\u2026not acceptable! What do you mean, gone?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1369599409dd49aab0e6c1c2ba77459e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: We suspect the new Sustainer has acquired their shifting abilities sooner
      than we expected. The entire perimeter of their origin dimension has been searched
      and we have no trace yet.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c86454fd71fe4258bbe97dd2023a6898, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Who is this \u201CSustainer\u201D they are talking about?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That cannot be possible, it takes years to truly master shifting. That
      is why this is the optimal time to act on our plans, so do not make this more
      difficult than it needs to be. Search again then, they must be there.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1369599409dd49aab0e6c1c2ba77459e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes sir, we will.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c86454fd71fe4258bbe97dd2023a6898, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: In the meantime, commence with the next phase of unification, we cannot
      wait any longer.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1369599409dd49aab0e6c1c2ba77459e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Unification? I wonder what they wanna unify, and why they're stressing
      out about it so much.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Sir, are you sure that's a good idea? If the Sustainer manages to\u2014"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c86454fd71fe4258bbe97dd2023a6898, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You dare talk back to me?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1369599409dd49aab0e6c1c2ba77459e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Of course not, sir, we will get right on it.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c86454fd71fe4258bbe97dd2023a6898, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Hm, it sounds like the voices are getting closer, I can understand them
      very clearly now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That's what I thought.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1369599409dd49aab0e6c1c2ba77459e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The voice is now crystal clear, as if it's coming right from the other
      side of this wall.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What about the hybrid?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1369599409dd49aab0e6c1c2ba77459e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Hybrid, as in Mr. Horse type hybrid? Surely, they don't mean him.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I should\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: db6143dffc3415a4cb9df1bede0e2ac3, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 710afa0ca7114da89851e23656ab2bfd, type: 2}
